      text: "Anh Ki\u1EC1n! Em... em ch\u1EA1y theo con c\u1EEBu r\u1ED3i l\u1EA1c m\u1EA5t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\u1EC1."
    - speaker: "B\xE9 Na"
      text: "Ch\u1ECB Lam ng\xE0y x\u01B0a hay d\u1EABn em ra \u0111\xE2y h\xE1t b\xE0i c\xFAng tr\u0103ng. Ch\u1ECB b\u1EA3o tr\u0103ng tr\u1EAFng l\xE0 tr\u0103ng hi\u1EC1n."
    - speaker: "B\xE9 Na"
      text: "C\u1EA7m c\xE1i n\xE0y \u0111i \u2014 m\u1EB9 d\u1EB7n em \u0111\u01B0a cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi canh l\xE0ng."
    startQuestOnEnd: 
    reportObjectiveOnEnd: 
    claimQuestOnEnd: 
    giveItemOnEnd: potion_hp
    setFlagOnEnd: npc:na_met
  questBlock:
    blockId: 
    lines: []
    startQuestOnEnd: 
    reportObjectiveOnEnd: 
    claimQuestOnEnd: 
    giveItemOnEnd: 
    setFlagOnEnd: 
  repeat:
